      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.25.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall the strong people glorify thee, the city of the terrible nations shall fear thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.25.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.25.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou hast been a defense to the poor, a defense to the needy in his distress, a refuge from the storm, a shade from the heat, when the blast of the terrible ones ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as a storm ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
