        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.25.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.25.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And on this mountain will the LORD of hosts make to all people a feast of fat things, a feast of wines on the lees, of fat things full of marrow, of wines on the lees well refined.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.25.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.25.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he will destroy on this mountain the face of the covering cast over all people, and the vail ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " spread over all nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.25.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.25.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will swallow up death in victory; and the Lord GOD will wipe away tears from off all faces; and the rebuke of his people will he remove from all the earth: for the LORD hath spoken ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
